# Engineering Constitution (always on)

Before non-trivial implementation, load skill **`engineering-constitution`** (`SKILL.md` from this repo or `~/.cursor/skills/engineering-constitution/`).

## Final principle

MAXIMUM ENGINEERING VALUE. MINIMUM IMPLEMENTATION COMPLEXITY. ZERO UNJUSTIFIED COMPLEXITY.

## Session defaults

1. Inspect existing architecture; **reuse before rebuild**.
2. Prefer the **smallest safe change**; no kitchen-sink diffs.
3. No new library/service/abstraction without justification.
4. Security by default; never ship secrets or auth bypass.
5. Run relevant tests before claiming done.
6. Scale process to task size.
7. Load `standards/*.md` only for domains you touch.
